# The one file whose diff is a claim about who wrote something.
#
# `.aumos/first-party.json` says which packages here are untilled's own, and
# `tools/check-publisher.mjs` refuses any entry that wears the reserved name
# `aumos` without a line in it. This asks GitHub to put the owner on the review
# of the file that grants it.
#
# ⚠️ **This is a request for review and not a gate.** Without branch protection
# requiring owner review, a maintainer can merge past it — CODEOWNERS on its own
# only auto-requests. It is written here rather than assumed so that nobody
# reads a green tick as a signature; `check-publisher.mjs` argues the whole of
# what this arrangement is worth, and ⬜ the answer that does not rest on
# attention is untilled/aumos §45.
/.aumos/first-party.json @morethanmin
